      "name": "Legal Queries",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Query - Criminal Law (Arabic)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"ما عقوبة السرقة في القانون المصري؟\",\n  \"top_k\": 5,\n  \"user_role\": \"citizen\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/query",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "query"]
            },
            "description": "Query about criminal law penalties in Egyptian law.\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `query` (required): Legal question in Arabic\n- `top_k` (optional): Number of sources to retrieve (1-50, default: 5)\n- `user_role` (optional): \"lawyer\" or \"citizen\" (default: \"citizen\")\n\n**Response:**\n- `answer`: Legal answer in Arabic\n- `source_chunks`: Retrieved legal documents\n- `category`: Question category (arabic_rag, law_ref, chat)\n- `latency_ms`: Response time in milliseconds\n- `confidence_score`: Answer confidence (0-1)\n- `llm_provider_used`: AI provider used"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Query - Criminal Law - Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"query\": \"ما عقوبة السرقة في القانون المصري؟\",\n  \"top_k\": 5,\n  \"user_role\": \"citizen\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/query",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["api", "v1", "query"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"answer\": \"الحكم القانوني الرئيسي: عقوبة السرقة تختلف حسب ظروف الجريمة...\\n\\n[المصدر: قانون العقوبات - المادة 313]\",\n  \"source_chunks\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"المادة 313: يعاقب بالأشغال الشاقة المؤبدة من وقعت منه سرقة...\",\n      \"law_name\": \"قانون العقوبات\",\n      \"article_number\": \"313\",\n      \"rerank_score\": 0.89\n    }\n  ],\n  \"category\": \"arabic_rag\",\n  \"latency_ms\": 12450,\n  \"confidence_score\": 0.89,\n  \"llm_provider_used\": \"modelstudio\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
